# Gabriel Passenger Possession Doc Sync

- Read `Custom/Scripts/Gabriel/features/passenger-possession/FEATURE.md`,
  `Custom/Scripts/Gabriel/FEATURE.md`, and
  `Custom/Scripts/Gabriel/docs/RUNTIME-OPTIMIZATION-HISTORY.md` before changing
  this area.
- Use `features/passenger-possession/FEATURE.md` references to pull adjacent
  Gabriel docs when passenger changes cross into scene-camera, head-hide, or
  palm-HUD behavior.
